# CI and workflows

- **PRs (`build.yml`):** Node, global `mystmd`, then `myst build --html`. Rewrite `http://localhost:3000` in `robots.txt` and `sitemap.xml` to `https://shishirshakya.github.io`. After the HTML build, copy `files/`, `fonts/`, and joined Readings `audio/*.mp3` into `_build/html`. Local Python under `scripts/` is not in the public repo.
- **Deploy (`deploy.yml` on `main`):** `myst build --html` with **no** `BASE_URL` (apex user Pages is site root; setting `BASE_URL` breaks the MyST "wrong BASE_URL" dialog), rewrite localhost sitemap URLs, copy `files/` (including `404.html` to site root), copy joined Readings from `audio/*.mp3` to `_build/html/audio/`, then [peaceiris/actions-gh-pages](https://github.com/peaceiris/actions-gh-pages) with `personal_token` pushing `_build/html` to `ShishirShakya.github.io` on **`master`** (secret `GH_PAGES_DEPLOY_TOKEN`).

If you add new required commands (linters, extra builds), add them to the same place in `build.yml` so PRs stay green with production behavior.
